      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This topic has been discussed extensively in [Developer Update - 9 April 2026](https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-9-april-2026/48173) and on the [👾BUT CAN IT RUN DOOM 🛠️VRChat Developer Stream](https://www.twitch.tv/videos/2744990527) (Apr 10, 2026), plus in other Canny threads.\n\nAnyone making game-ready assets / avatars can tell 70k is very generous already. Tupper has said the limits would likely be decreased to 60k for medium, 65k for poor, 70k for very poor, and not increased.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
