  "details": "I'd like to request a change on the avatar performance ranking system for PC.\n\nI can understand that the mobile has different ranking system, but for PC it seems that medium and poor are both 70K polygons. Why is this?\n\nIt could be adjusted to this:\n\n32.000 - Excellent\n\n70.000 - Good\n\n100.000 - Medium\n\n150.000 - Poor\n\nFor example, my avatar is light and could be considered a poor rank, but having a little too much triangle gives my avatar an very poor rank. My friends keeps accusing me of having a heavy avatar when it's not the case.\n\nLook pictures below.",
